## Performance Considerations

### Database Queries

**Optimized:**
- Indexes on foreign keys (instance_id, process_id)
- Indexes on status fields
- Indexes on tenant_id (for RLS)
- JSONB GIN indexes for variables

**Connection Management:**
- Uses Supabase pooler (NullPool in SQLAlchemy)
- Async operations throughout
- Context managers for session management

### Event System

- In-memory event bus (no external dependency)
- Async handlers (non-blocking)
- Error handling in handlers (failures don't break workflow)

